31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I'm afraid the night has brought us a sobering reality. Before we begin, let us see who among us is still here and what the morning reveals.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It seems we are all still here. No one was attacked last night, which is an interesting start. Does this mean the Werewolf was hesitant, or perhaps they are playing a longer game?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wait, nobody got eaten?! That's so weird! Maybe the wolf was too scared to pick someone, or maybe they're just playing a trick on us! What do you think, Misaki?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"It is unusual. Usually, the Werewolf attacks on the first night to reduce our numbers. Perhaps they are trying to build trust by appearing harmless, or they are waiting for more information.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most intriguing development. To refrain from an attack is a bold move, suggesting a wolf who values strategic positioning over immediate attrition. Or perhaps they simply couldn't decide who was the most appetizing?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"While the lack of an attack is curious, we must not let it lull us into a false sense of security. As the Seer, I have information that may be vital to our survival.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"You're the Seer, Jonathan? That's a bold claim to make so early. Please, tell us what you've discovered. Who did you divine, and what was the result?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Who did you check, Jonathan? Tell us, tell us! Was it someone spooky?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'm curious as well. If you're truly the Seer, sharing your findings now could give us a significant advantage before the Werewolf can react.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a revelation of this nature could be the catalyst we need. Please, Jonathan, do enlighten us. Who has been scrutinized under your divine gaze, and what did you find?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear: she is the Werewolf. I believe we have our target for today's vote.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"That is a blatant lie. I am a Villager. Jonathan is claiming to be the Seer simply to frame me and lead the village into a mistake. Please, do not trust him so easily.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, what?! Mizuki is the wolf? But she seemed so smart and helpful! Jonathan, are you super sure? I don't want to vote for the wrong person!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"This is a very direct accusation. If Jonathan is lying, he's likely the wolf or the possessed trying to eliminate a trusted player. But if he's telling the truth, we've already won. It's a huge risk for either side.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A high-stakes gamble indeed. If Jonathan is the Seer, the game ends today. If he is the wolf, he has just attempted a masterstroke of deception. Mizuki, your defense is quite standard; how do you respond to the specificity of the claim?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have no reason to lie. As the Seer, my goal is to protect the village, and identifying the Werewolf immediately is the most efficient way to ensure our victory. I urge you all to vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I am innocent. Jonathan is attempting to manipulate you all by claiming a role he doesn't have. If you execute me, you are losing a loyal human and playing right into the Werewolf's hands. Please, think logically.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm so confused! Jonathan sounds so sure, but Mizuki is being so logical! If I vote for Mizuki and she's a human, I'll feel terrible! What do you think, Misaki?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, we win now. If he's the wolf, he's desperate. However, the Seer's role is to reveal the wolf. I'm inclined to trust Jonathan's directness, but I'll wait to see Benjamin's take.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a classic stalemate of credibility. However, Jonathan's willingness to reveal himself so early is a risk a Werewolf rarely takes unless they are desperate. I find his confidence compelling. I shall cast my vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
